<h2>About</h2>
<p>The infinite monkey theorem says that you can produce just about anything you want with an infinite number of monkeys typing on keyboards. It's never really been tested in real life, but these three brothers have decided to give a go at it and see what happens.</p>

<!-- Authors come from src/_data/authors.json. Photos go in src/pictures/. -->
<section class="authors">
  {%- for id, a in authors %}
  <div class="author" id="{{ id }}">
    <div class="avatar"><img src="{{ a.photo }}" alt="{{ a.name }}"></div>
    <h3>{{ a.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ a.bio }}</p>
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
